WEBVTT

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:15.870
Is everyone here?

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:17.870
We need to talk about something.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.200
What is it?

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:23.830
Actually, while you guys
were busy playing Stage 3...

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:31.580
Onigasaki.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:35.370
How long have you been there, Oshigiri?

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:40.870
How about you save your stealth
for inside the games?

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:45.410
I thought I'd get myself a pelt
from a certain disgusting animal.

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:51.750
It's like there's no one around...

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:53.660
And not just here...

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:57.540
I passed by numerous buildings
on the way here from the forest,

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:59.870
but every one was vacant.

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:02.750
Except for us, there's not a person in sight.

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:05.160
Do you think the whole city is empty?

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:09.290
I doubt that alpaca can run
a city of this size by himself.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.950
There has to be some link to the outside...

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:21.000
Let's head back. If he finds us, we're--

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.200
But I've already found you.

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:32.080
What... the heck?

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:35.500
♪ Ding dong, ding neigh. ♪

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:37.500
Emergency notice.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.290
As a penalty for breaking the rules,

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:46.790
I prepared a difficulty-level "S" stage
and have temporarily sealed the tower.

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:50.200
My apologies to those dragged into this.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:55.120
Stage 4: "Exterminate
the Mimicry Man-eaters."

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:58.000
Let us begin.

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:10.910
"The Ones Within"

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:37.700
Stay out of trouble, idiot!

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:39.040
Watch your heads!

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:41.790
Wha--?!

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:44.080
You trying to kill us or something?!

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:46.000
I helped you out, didn't I?

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.040
You grazed me, you shit head!

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:51.040
Oh, that's nothing. It'll heal with a lick.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.750
I can't reach that! I'm not a chameleon!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.580
Hey, cut it out.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:06.200
Why do people insist on fighting so much?

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:14.330
Yuzu!

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:18.410
Akki! Anboy! You guys
take the long way around!

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:20.620
Meet in the basement food storage room!

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:21.830
Okay!

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:28.910
And to think how energetic you answered...

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:31.540
I'm very ashamed...

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:34.290
Don't matter to me.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.910
You take one, too.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:39.700
Anya, I get D's in Phys Ed.

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:42.700
I'm not expecting much anyway.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:46.370
What's the matter?

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:49.290
Nothing at all. Let's get moving.

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:52.830
Huh?

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:54.120
Karin?

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:57.160
Didn't you go running off the other direction?

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:04.790
Something's up with her!

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:07.540
Karin, are you all right?

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:09.910
Huh?

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:12.160
Hey, get back! She's...

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:13.750
It's not occult girl!

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.830
Ow! Ow, ow!

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.540
I swear I'm not tasty!

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:21.000
You little...!

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:29.330
The hell were you thinking?!

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:31.200
I'm sorry!

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:33.870
Oh! We're almost to the exit!

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:40.790
Anya?

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:43.080
It's fine, go without me...

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:45.250
Anya! Anya!

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:03.040
It stopped?

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:04.540
Why?

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:07.790
The sunset?

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.660
Yup, he's asleep.

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:11.950
He ran out of juice and is out like a light.

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:15.120
"Komemachi Sons"
"Pre-Washed Rice"
He ran out of juice and is out like a light.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:19.080
Anboy here hasn't got
much sleep in a few days.

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:21.370
He won't wake up no matter what we do.

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:23.290
He's such a nuisance.

00:06:23.290 --> 00:06:27.910
Thank goodness. Anya was saying
something about medicine before.

00:06:27.910 --> 00:06:29.950
Sleeping pills, perhaps?

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:32.160
He always carried some around with him.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.540
Well, we can just ask him later.

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:38.620
Right now, we ought to focus
on that Karin look-a-like.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:41.910
It was probably one of those
Mimicry Man-eaters.

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:46.870
If we win by exterminating them,
there's probably a bit more than one.

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:48.370
Ugh...

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:51.000
What kind of creature was it exactly?

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.830
It looked completely identical to Karin.

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:55.160
However...

00:06:56.200 --> 00:07:00.000
She approached me slowly
with a creepy alien smile...

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.330
Hey, that kinda pisses me off.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:05.700
And then she squeezed me
so tightly... I was traumatized...

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:07.410
You're pissing me off!

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:09.500
--Hmph!
--In any case,

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:12.330
I think we should investigate a bit.

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:15.370
Kai, I'd like to grab some
things from my room.

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:18.080
Would you be kind enough
to be my bodyguard?

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.200
Yeah, piece of cake.

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:23.750
Also, Zak and Akki...

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.910
I have a different favor to ask you two.

00:07:28.950 --> 00:07:31.000
It's not moving an inch.

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:33.620
And it shrunk a whole bunch, too...

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:36.250
What does Roromori want with this?

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:39.830
I'm sure Yuzu has some sort of good plan.

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:43.250
By the way, I take it you and
Roromori know each other?

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:44.450
Yeah.

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:47.700
Though this is the first time we've met.

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:51.660
She's mysterious... It feels
like we've met before...

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:54.790
We're back!

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:56.790
A-Anya!

00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:59.830
He woke up a second ago.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:04.580
Good... morning.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:06.250
Feeling groggy still?

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:09.080
I was worried when you collapsed like that.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.200
Where is this?

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:14.290
The food storage room. I was worried.

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:16.660
I fell asleep?

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:19.120
Ah, crap...

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:21.620
Yes, crap. I was worried.

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:25.660
"Komemachi Sons"
"Pre-Washed Rice"

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:27.950
"Komemachi Sons"
"Pre-Washed Rice"
It's not even a big deal.

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:32.790
It's common in my family to inherit
some sort of sleep disorder.

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:34.660
I can't fall asleep normally.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:36.660
I have to force it with medicine...

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:39.870
...or just wait till I hit
my limit and collapse.

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:42.700
I started streaming to
keep myself busy at night.

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:48.040
Uh, end of story! Quit staring!

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:51.040
That's why you always have
bags under your eyes...

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:52.080
Pretty much.

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:54.580
Is that why you're always
annoyed all the time?

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:56.080
Argh, pretty much!

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:57.830
You forget your makeup?

00:08:57.830 --> 00:08:59.580
Huh?! What the hell are--

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:01.950
Time for a snack. Bread is the bomb!

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:07.660
Isn't it so yummy?

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:09.950
Uh, yeah...

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:12.750
Himiko's become such a strong girl!

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:15.370
"Roromori"

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:17.830
"Roromori"
Where did I put it, meow?

00:09:17.830 --> 00:09:20.790
I'll stomp on you!

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:22.830
Ooh, there it is!

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:24.200
"Gene Structure"
"The Chemical Formula of Men and Women"

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.950
What's that stuff?

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:31.200
It's the ace up my sleeve.

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:33.250
There's poison in it.

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:37.160
Why do you have that?

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:40.200
Hmm? It's just a hobby of mine.

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:44.500
A photo of Iride...

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:46.370
Roro, you dropped...

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:59.120
What's the matter?

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.790
"Experiment in Progress
No peeking!
Yuzu"

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:09.700
You can't beat this stuff...

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:21.500
Keep this a secret from Akki.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.500
It's embarrassing.

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:32.790
Eradicate?

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.410
That's right.

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:39.080
While we've been busy running around,
the ivy has overrun the tower.

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:42.750
I thought about fighting it with fire,
but we're inside, so...

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:46.290
Instead, we'll wait for sunset
and begin the eradication.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:49.370
It's definitely the quickest way to handle it.

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:52.540
We'll divide these up
and inject them into the roots.

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:54.040
What is this stuff?

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:56.290
It's poison.

00:10:56.290 --> 00:11:00.540
If you come across a Man-eater,
give it a whole shot of this.

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:02.910
It'll die from the inside out.

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:08.620
What a pretty color.
I've never seen anything like it.

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:11.830
R-Right?! It's a raw undiluted solution!

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:14.540
It's made to ward off
the jungle's big predators!

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:17.540
The translucence and color
totally blows my mind!

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:20.660
That's my Akki! I knew you'd
be able to appreciate it!

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:21.450
Uh-huh!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.910
Hey! What if one of those breaks?!

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:26.120
Huh? He'd totally kick the bucket.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:27.950
Stand up for yourself!

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.750
Roromori.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:31.700
Why do you even have that?

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.200
Didn't you know, Zakk?

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:38.830
Walking alone at night can be dangerous.

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:43.370
To keep perverts at bay, girls these days
carry their own personal poison.

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:46.200
P-Personal poison?

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:50.830
I-I had no idea...
'Cuz I go to a boys' school...

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:52.000
They don't!

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:55.950
Even Himi knows how smart
it is to arm herself.

00:11:55.950 --> 00:11:57.910
We can never be too prepared.

00:11:57.910 --> 00:12:00.910
That's right. I'm all for self-defense.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.950
More like excessive force!

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:07.290
♪ Ding dong, ding neigh. ♪

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:10.370
Good morning. This is Paka.

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:13.950
It's now been one day since starting Stage 4.

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:16.950
I'm glad to see you're all in good health.

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:20.540
Now then, I have some great news to share.

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:25.330
One week has passed in your real
Let's Play... and my goodness!

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:29.660
The view count has passed 5,000,000!

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:33.660
You've achieved that faster
than anyone in history.

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:40.200
As the supervisor of the glorious
13th Avenue... I'm so honored.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:48.080
If this is 13th Avenue, does that mean
there're other cities like this?

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:50.950
Are there others kept captive
and forced to play games--

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:53.000
Mr. Oshigiri.

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:56.290
Have you forgotten the meaning of this stage?

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:02.290
Do you have an apology for me?

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:04.160
We just got lost.

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:06.200
Oh? Lost?

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:13.540
Running, are we? Despite what it might
seem like, I do love playing tag.

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:15.290
Then go play by yourself!

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:17.830
Did you get him?

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:20.950
I don't know, but I'm sure I hit something.

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:32.540
He's a monster!

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:39.580
It's punishment for you
who touched upon a taboo.

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:42.660
You mustn't do any needless exploring.

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:48.790
Got it? Follow the ivy and try
to pinpoint where the core is.

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:51.040
We all need to be working in pairs.

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:53.290
Even at night, avoid being alone.

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:54.080
Right.

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:56.830
Those on standby will stand our ground here.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:59.500
I'll be working on a follow-up plan.

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:01.580
Karirin will be assisting me.

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:03.620
Himi will prepare dinner.

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:06.200
Makimaki is on sleeping duty.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:08.450
Don't you guys have it easy?

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:11.330
That's not true at all.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:15.290
Though, it'll be problematic
to tell apart real and fake people.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:17.450
Shall we decide a password?

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:19.950
I've got it...

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:21.660
Wh-What?

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:23.870
Let's make it something about Karirin.

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:26.080
What does she remind you of?

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:27.410
Facial pummel.

00:14:27.410 --> 00:14:29.410
That only applies to you, Akki.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:31.040
How about short-tempered?

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:32.000
Scaredy.

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:33.200
Noisy.

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:35.450
Good ideas! Have any others?

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:36.120
Chicken.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:36.910
Gorilla.

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:38.080
Chi-Chickrilla.

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:40.750
Um, hello? You're pissing me off.

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:42.370
I'll kill all of you.

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:43.370
Hey, everyone!

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:44.200
Hmm?

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:47.290
Before you all go, why don't you have one?

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:51.000
Approved! Listen up, guys!

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:54.080
When one person says "Karin,"
the other says "Pudding!"

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:56.040
Yes! Pudding, pudding!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.660
She already broke you in?!

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.080
The operation begins in ten seconds!

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:02.750
I wish you all good luck!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:05.250
--Disband!
--Yeah!

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:06.750
Hey, wait!

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:17.000
It grows fast but withers even faster.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:19.660
Don't dawdle around. Let's move on.

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:25.080
Anya.

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:26.370
Eh?

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:30.830
About that... sleeping
medication that you use...

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:35.040
If you asked Mr. Paka,
I think he would get some for you.

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:37.330
Hell no. Ain't happening.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:40.040
Why the hell would I ask
that creep for a favor?

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:42.700
I'll do the asking for you.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:44.540
Mind your own business!

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:45.750
But...

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:49.040
It'd piss me off for you
to ask him a favor, too.

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:58.660
Mr. Paka. You're seeing this, right?

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:01.290
I'd like to talk to you later.

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:04.000
As you wish, Mr. Iride.

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.950
Cut it out, Onigasaki.

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:13.040
Why not? Smacking them both
sounds fine to me.

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:16.000
Don't. Aikawa's done nothing wrong.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.700
If only it were Kudou...

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:19.200
Wanna piece, huh?!

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:22.790
You okay, Iride?

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:25.080
Jerk. I'll seriously wallop you later.

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:29.870
Anyway, why is it even active at night?

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:34.750
Who knows? Maybe it saved up
energy during the daytime.

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:37.700
Makino, Karin! When I say Karin...

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:40.620
No use, Iride. That's pointless.

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:41.450
Huh?

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:43.290
Aikawa...

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:46.000
...was fast asleep when
we decided the password!

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:48.330
Wake him up if you noticed!

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:53.120
Huh? Do you think that it's sleeping?

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:57.290
Oh! I've seen that happen
on the train! So soothing...

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:58.370
Don't be soothed!

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:00.250
Let's just do them both...

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:03.290
Wait! Why are you always
so quick to resort to force?

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:05.040
Because I hate waiting.

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:08.080
They're both frickin' impostors!

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:16.370
"Genome Tower" "30F Outdoor Bath"
"10F Cafeteria" "6F Guest Room" "5F Theater"
Everything but the main facilities
being locked was a blessing in disguise.

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:19.200
It was really only able
to grow in the hallways.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:20.790
Did you have enough vials?

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:22.620
We've got five left now.

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:25.950
Well, I've got plenty other plans if need be.

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:28.830
We'll have to see what tomorrow brings.

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:44.830
Wake up.

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:46.120
Hey.

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:52.250
What's the matter?

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:53.790
I have to pee...

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:55.120
Huh?

00:17:56.120 --> 00:18:00.540
Come to the bathroom with me!
We're supposed to stay in pairs!

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:06.580
You really, really, really,
really better not leave!

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:08.540
I'm right here.

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:22.790
I need to use the bathroom, too...

00:18:44.160 --> 00:18:46.040
Y-You scared me.

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:49.250
Yuzu, this is the men's restroom.

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:54.160
Yuzu? Huh?

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:04.000
I knew it. Right again.

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:05.950
Don't you know?

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:08.870
Akki is ambidextrous.

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:11.250
Though left-handed until kindergarten,

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.580
he switched over to right
before elementary school.

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:17.330
Now he writes left-handed. Chopsticks, left.

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:19.580
Handshakes right. Catches balls right.

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:22.250
Bats either way. Turns faucets with left.

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:25.250
And when he goes to protect himself...

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:26.580
Left.

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:29.120
You protected your face with your right hand.

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:31.330
Did I now?

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:33.450
And stopped the faucet right-handed.

00:19:33.450 --> 00:19:36.410
Communication, self-defense,
the ability to lie...

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:39.120
You're way smarter than
the other Man-eaters.

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:43.290
Perhaps you're their leader
or something like that?

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:47.790
Um, Yuzu? It's me, Iride. Akatsuki Iride.

00:19:56.120 --> 00:19:58.700
Hey, don't underestimate me.

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:02.750
I've dedicated my entire
life to observing Akki.

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:06.830
Out of love, resentment, and curiosity...

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:13.660
To be honest, I could care less
if you really were actually Akki.

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:16.910
I've always wanted to dissect you.

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:20.500
Because I love you so much.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:24.910
Your outside, your inside, everything...

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:28.250
I've got to complete you!

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:33.410
Hey, what in the world are you anyway?

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:38.370
Thanks to you, my research will never be--

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:03.450
It's not fair to smile like that.

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:07.500
I was actually lost on
what to do for a moment.

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:23.700
Looks like it's all withered away.

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:26.620
I guess the poison did its job.

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:29.790
More importantly, what's up with those two?

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:37.410
Even I feel a little guilty, you know?

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:39.250
About what?

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:46.500
The only thing that matters
is that you're safe.

00:21:46.500 --> 00:21:48.660
Thank you.

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:55.120
I should've kissed him while
I had the chance, meow!

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:56.540
Hmm?

00:22:06.290 --> 00:22:07.540
Anya.

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:08.750
Eh?
